  "report": {
    "title": "Numbered lists >10 overflow to the next line",
    "body": "### Check before submitting\n\n- [x] I searched existing issues and did not find a duplicate\n\n### Describe the bug\n\nDue to the fixed pixel value for mbe-indent-size, the numbered list marker becomes too large when the number is more than a single digit. This results in the list appearing broken.\n\nExpected: The width of the span containing the marker is scaled with the item number.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n[Post on demo instance.](https://demo.usememos.com/memos/oTkdPies2SrkHyhHffyiT6)\n\n### Memos version\n\nv26.11.0\n\n### Additional context\n\n_No response_",
