      "Click the Save button to post the memo",
      "Look at the rendered numbered list in the posted memo, specifically items 10 and 11"
    ],
    "expected": "In the rendered memo, the numbered list items 10 and 11 each show their number marker and their text on the same line, and the list does not look broken",
    "reported_actual": "When list numbers have more than one digit, the marker becomes too wide because of the fixed pixel indent size, so it overflows and the item text wraps to the next line, making the list look broken",
    "missing": [
      "The report only links to a demo memo and gives no steps; the exact list content is unknown",
